# **KTH564A1 Series**

## **Sensitivity Adjustable, Linear Hall-effect Sensor**



 Proportional Linear Hall-effect Magnetic Sensor


 Wide Operating Voltage：2.8V~6.0V


 [Low Power Consumption: 3.3mA@5.0V V](mailto:3.3mA@5.0V) DD

 Low-Noise Output


 Responds to either positive or negative gauss


 Sensitivity Adjustable: 1.5mV/Gs 2.0mV/Gs


2.5mV/Gs 3.0mV/Gs


 Package: DFN2020-6L, DFN1616-6L


 Operating Temperature：-40℃~125℃


 Robust ESD Performance：HBM 4KV


 RoHS Compliant 2011/65/EU and Halogen Free


**2** **Applications**

 Current sensing


 Motor control


 Position sensing


 Vibration sensing


 Liquid level sensing


 Weight sensing


 Proximity sensing


 Rotary encoder


 Ferrous metal detector


**3** **Typical Application Circuit**


Note：C1： 1nF/10V


C2：10nF/10V



**4** **Descriptions**

KTH564A1 is a sensitivity adjustable of linear


Hall-effect sensor, is composed of Hall sensor,


linear amplifier and Totem-Pole output stage. It


features low noise output, which use an external


capacitance. It also can provide increased


temperature stability and accuracy. The linear Hall


sensor has a wide operating temperature range of


-40℃ to +125℃, appropriate for commercial,


consumer, and industrial environments.


The high sensitivity of Hall-effect sensor accurately


tracks extremely weak changes in magnetic flux


density. The linear sourcing output voltage is set by


the supply voltage and in proportion of vary of the


magnetic flux density. That is proportional to the


applied magnetics and features a null voltage


output of half of the applied voltage.


KTH564A1 family provides a variety of package to


customers:DFN2020-6L,DFN1616-6L. All packages


are RoHS compliant.


KTH564A1E-DS6


KTH564A1E-DZ6



昆泰芯微电子科技有限公司 **1**


