（5）Power on Time


When the applied voltage is into the device, the device output requires a response time to react to the


ratiometry magnetic field.


（6）Null Voltage output


In the zero magnetic field state, the output voltage is half of the applied voltage V DD .


（7）Sensitivity


The amount of the output voltage is proportional to the magnetic field’s changes. This proportionality is


specified as the below:



